H7719.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 24:27; 
son of: Jaaziah (H3269); 
brother of: Beno (H1121B), Zaccur (H2139I) and Ibri (H5681) 
§ Shoham = "onyx"
a Merarite Levite, son of Jaaziah

H7724G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:49; 
son of: Caleb (H3612H) and Maacah (H4601L); 
brother of: Sheber (H7669), Tirhanah (H8647) and Shaaph (H8174H); 
half-brother of: Hur (H2354), Jesher (H3475), Shobab (H7727H), Ardon (H0715), Mareshah@1 Chroniques 2:42 (H4337), Haran (H2771B), Moza (H4162), Gazez (H1495), Jahdai (H3056) and Achsah (H5915H); 
father of: Machbenah (H4343) and Gibea (H1388)
§ Sheva = "Jehovah contends"
Judaite, son of Caleb by his concubine Maachah and grandson of Hezron

H7724H.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 8:17; 
father of: Elihoreph (H0456) and Ahijah (H0281); also called Shavsha at 1 Chroniques 18:16; Sheva(Ketiv: Sheya) at 2 Samuel 20:25; Shisha at 1 Rois 4:3;
Another name of se.ra.yah (שְׂרָיָהוּ "Seraiah" H8304G)
§ Sheva = "Jehovah contends"
Judaite, son of Caleb by his concubine Maachah and grandson of Hezron

H7727G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 5:14; 
son of: David (H1732) and Bathsheba (H1339); 
brother of: Shammua (H8051H), Nathan (H5416) and Solomon (H8010); 
half-brother of: Amnon (H0550), Chileab (H3609), Absalom (H0053), Adonijah (H0138), Shephatiah (H8203), Ithream (H3507), Ibhar (H2984), Elishua (H0474), Nepheg (H5298H), Japhia (H3309I), Elishama (H0476H), Eliada (H0450), Eliphelet (H0467), Tamar (H8559H), Elpelet (H0467I), Nogah (H5052) and Jerimoth (H3406N)
§ Shobab = "rebellious"
1) son of David by Bathsheba
2) a Judaite, son of Caleb by his wife Azubah and grandson of Hezron

H7727H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:18; 
son of: Caleb (H3612H) and Jerioth(?) (H3408); 
brother of: Hur (H2354), Jesher (H3475), Ardon (H0715), Mareshah@1 Chroniques 2:42 (H4337), Haran (H2771B), Moza (H4162), Gazez (H1495), Jahdai (H3056), Sheber (H7669), Tirhanah (H8647), Shaaph (H8174H), Sheva (H7724) and Achsah (H5915H)
§ Shobab = "rebellious"
1) son of David by Bathsheba
2) a Judaite, son of Caleb by his wife Azubah and grandson of Hezron

H7732G.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:20; 
son of: Seir (H8165B); 
brother of: Lotan (H3877), Zibeon (H6649H), Anah (H6034H), Dishon (H1787), Ezer (H0687), Dishan (H1789) and Timna (H8555H); 
father of: Alvan (H5935), Manahath (H4506B), Ebal (H5858B), Shepho (H8195), Onam (H0208)
§ Shobal = "flowing"
1) the 2nd son of Seir the Horite (Edom) and one of the dukes of the Horites
2) son of Caleb, grandson of Hur, and founder of Kirjath-jearim
3) a Judaite, son of Hur and a descendant of Caleb
3a) possibly the same as 2

H7732H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:50; 
son of: Hur (H2354); 
brother of: Uri (H0221), Salma (H8007H), Hareph (H2780), Jezreel (H3157J), Ishma (H3457), Idbash (H3031), Hazzelelponi (H6753), Penuel (H6439H) and Ezer (H5829); 
father of: Haroeh (H7204)
§ Shobal = "flowing"
1) the 2nd son of Seir the Horite (Edom) and one of the dukes of the Horites
2) son of Caleb, grandson of Hur, and founder of Kirjath-jearim
3) a Judaite, son of Hur and a descendant of Caleb
3a) possibly the same as 2

H7744.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 25:2; 
son of: Abraham (H0085) and Keturah (H6989); 
half-brother of: Ishmael (H3458) and Isaac (H3327); 
brother of: Zimran (H2175), Jokshan (H3370), Medan (H4091), Midian (H4080) and Ishbak (H3435) 
§ Shuah = "wealth"
son of Abraham by his wife Keturah

H7748.def:
A man of the tribe of Dan living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:23; 
son of: Dan (H1835H); also called Shuham at Nombres 26:42,43; 
Another name of chu.shim (חֻשִׁים "Hushim" H2366B) 
§ Shuham = "pit-digger"
son of Dan and progenitor of the family of Shuhamites

H7749.def:
Someone descended from Shuham who was a man of the tribe of Dan living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:23; 
son of: Dan (H1835H); also called Shuham at Nombres 26:42,43; 
Group of chu.shim (חֻשִׁים "Hushim" H2366B) 
§ Shuhamites, of Shuam "pit-digger"
descendants of Shuham, the son of Dan

H7763H.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:32; 
son of: Heber (H2268); 
brother of: Japhlet (H3310), Hotham (H2369) and Shua (H7774); 
father of: Ahi (H0277H), Rohgah (H7303), Jehubbah (H3160) and Aram (H0758J); also called Shemer (KJV: Shamer) at 1 Chroniques 7:34; 
Also named: she.mer (שֶׁ֫מֶר "Shemer" H8106H)
§ Shomer = "keeper"
1) son of Jehozabad or Shimrith the Moabitess and one of the conspirators who slew king Joash of Judah
2) an Asherite, son of Heber
2a) also 'Shemer'

H7764.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692)
Also named: shu.ni (שׁוּנִי "Shunite" H7765) 
§ Shuni = "fortunate"
son of Gad and progenitor of the family of Shunites

H7765.def:
Someone descended from Shuni who was a man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692)
Group of shu.ni (שׁוּנִי "Shuni" H7764) 
§ Shunites, of Shuna "fortunate"
descendants of Shuni

H7777B.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:36; 
son of: Zophah (H6690); 
brother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Beri (H1275), Imrah (H3236), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878); 
father of: Arah (H0733), Hanniel (H2592H) and Rizia (H7525); also called Ulla at 1 Chroniques 7:39; 
Also named: ul.la (עֻלָּא "Ulla" H5925)
§ Shual = "jackal"
a district in Benjamin probably north of Michmash

H7781.def:
Someone descended from Muppim who was a man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:21; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Shephupham (KJV, NIV: Shupham) at Nombres 26:39; Shephuphan at 1 Chroniques 8:5; 
Group of mup.pim (מֻפִּים "Muppim" H4649) 
§ Shuphamites, of Shupham "bareness"
Benjamites, the descendants of Shupham

H7798.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 8:17; 
father of: Elihoreph (H0456) and Ahijah (H0281); also called Shavsha at 1 Chroniques 18:16; Sheva(Ketiv: Sheya) at 2 Samuel 20:25; Shisha at 1 Rois 4:3;
Another name of se.ra.yah (שְׂרָיָהוּ "Seraiah" H8304G) 
§ Shavsha = "nobility"
the royal scribe or secretary for David
